findings.comment:
750.800e - The following non-food contact surfaces were soiled:
A) under equipment at food service counter (food debris/dust);
B) bottom inside cookie oven (carbon);
C) counter under cookie oven (dust/food debris);   and
D) ice machines - bagged ice drain trays (general buildup/debris).

Clean non-food contact surfaces daily/as needed to eliminate buildup of debris.

